WEBVTT

00:02:56.913 --> 00:03:00.871
Leigh Whipper, who was the oldest living
Black actor at the time,

00:03:00.871 --> 00:03:06.246
historian John Henrik Clarke
and tap dancer Honi Coles.

00:03:06.913 --> 00:03:09.413
I had found myself.

00:03:10.121 --> 00:03:13.454
I had a history to call my own.

00:03:13.788 --> 00:03:16.746
I, too, according to Langston Hughes,

00:03:16.788 --> 00:03:20.079
I too, was, am America.

00:03:20.704 --> 00:03:23.288
And from that day forward,

00:03:23.288 --> 00:03:25.871
my life was forever changed.

00:03:27.121 --> 00:03:32.704
Today, from our boardrooms
to our classrooms,